{"detail": {"templateUuid": "073a97cac7214569bbcf07bdd02181d0", "projectUuid": "7376b3595cf44068ab9389899c44c0c3", "name": "琴爱", "description": "在一座被“稳定”与“秩序”统治的东方机械古城里，所有人都是被规训的木偶。他们体内嵌着琴弦。弦越稳定，人越安全。一旦情绪剧烈波动，琴弦便会断裂。于是：人们不再真正相爱不再失控、不再自由。\n男主是一名“修弦师”。他相信：规则、秩序、精准，才是正确的人生。\n直到某一天。他遇见了一个“错误频率”的女人。\n她会在废弃戏台唱跑调的戏曲，\n会让机械鸟停在肩膀，\n会在街道里奔跑，\n会让整座城市的编钟失拍。\n她活得像一场危险的梦。\n而她胸口的弦，只剩最后几根。\n当两个频率截然不同的人开始靠近，\n整座机械城市，也开始逐渐失控。", "coverUrl": "/assets/6b3caa60645e32b5.webp", "finalOutput": "https://libtv-res.liblib.art/upload-images/27d233d77ffb47109dd6ef1b76c32406/1997c7acefbae7c2f57d7c1543cfc1e0d43ed34e.mp4", "snapshotId": 15890, "auditStatus": 1, "ownerId": 9650447, "ownerUuid": "27d233d77ffb47109dd6ef1b76c32406", "avatar": "/assets/67b614a59d66bcd8.webp", "nickname": "内向的小小火龙", "isLike": false, "likeCount": 6, "tags": [{"id": 1303, "code": "short_animation", "tagLabel": "动画短片", "parentTag": 1300, "categoryId": 0, "path": "1300/1303/", "tagStatus": 1, "tagOrder": 3, "tagIcon": "", "children": null, "tagType": 1}, {"id": 3035, "code": "prod", "tagLabel": "大乱斗｜vol.2《AI，想象和尖叫》", "parentTag": 0, "categoryId": 0, "path": "3035/", "tagStatus": 1, "tagOrder": 10, "tagIcon": "", "children": null, "tagType": 5}], "score": 0, "socialMediaUrl": "https://v.douyin.com/Xk7llVapHk8/ :8pm u@S.Lw 03/23 TLW:/", "createAt": "2026年05月30日 20:10", "updateAt": "2026年06月01日 17:02", "publishAt": "2026年06月01日 16:41", "honors": ["最佳脑洞"], "awardedTag": ["最佳脑洞"], "playCount": 6, "viewCreationProcessCount": 1, "copyCanvasCount": 0, "shareCount": 0, "snapshotPath": "/data/canvas-snapshots/073a97cac7214569bbcf07bdd02181d0.json.gz", "snapshotSummary": {"nodes": 61, "edges": 160}}, "recommendList": []}